Subject: [PATCH] Match BZI6 device image property access

# Reason: attempt32 line1195 reports PATTERN_NOT_FOUND because BZI6 DeviceImageManager$1 uses `const-string` and places the SystemProperties call directly after it, while the existing device image mod only matches `const-string/jumbo` with blank-line spacing. Support both equivalent Smali forms so the target SCPM model code remains pinned to G965F.
# Affected: unica/mods/device_image/customize.sh.
# Verify: run the production customizer against the decoded BZI6 DeviceImageManager$1; verify the exact retail model literal and no property lookup remain; test jumbo/spacing compatibility and a changed-anchor negative; bash syntax, ordered patch replay, and clean attempt33.
